# Famick Home Management — scheduler crontab
# Each line invokes the same image's `run-job` mode for one job.
# Runs in the scheduler container (single instance per deployment); idempotency
# is enforced by IDistributedLockService inside each job.

# Daily notification evaluation (07:00 UTC).
0 7 * * * dotnet /app/Famick.HomeManagement.Web.dll run-job notifications-daily

# 5-minute calendar reminder polling.
*/5 * * * * dotnet /app/Famick.HomeManagement.Web.dll run-job calendar-reminders

# 15-minute external calendar sync (iCal/Google).
*/15 * * * * dotnet /app/Famick.HomeManagement.Web.dll run-job external-calendar-sync

# Daily account deletion (08:30 UTC): final reminders, then purge households and users
# whose 30-day grace period has run out.
30 8 * * * dotnet /app/Famick.HomeManagement.Web.dll run-job account-purge
